      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-calculus-1999-p2.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We wish to maximize \\(\\sin x \\cdot \\cos x=\\frac{1}{2} \\sin 2 x\\). But \\(\\sin 2 x \\leq 1\\), with equality holding for \\(x=\\pi / 4\\), so the maximum is \\(\\frac{1}{2}\\).",
